    + "            smaller := next\n"
    + "        larger\n"
    + "\n"
    + "// The largest magnitude an `Int` holds exactly, in either direction: 2^53 - 1.\n"
    + "// The range being symmetric is what lets `checkedSub` negate its right operand\n"
    + "// and hand the result to `checkedAdd`.\n"
    + "let intLimit: Int = 9_007_199_254_740_991\n"
    + "\n"
    + "(** The sum of `left` and `right`, or `None` when it would leave the range an\n"
    + "    `Int` holds exactly. The test is a pre-check, so no intermediate here ever\n"
    + "    leaves that range (Primitive Types §2.1). *)\n"
    + "export let checkedAdd(left: Int, right: Int): Option(Int) =\n"
